      { "sa": "bhīma-abhirakṣitam", "en": "guarded by Bhīma" }
    ],
    "translation": "That force of ours, guarded by Bhīṣma, is insufficient. But this force of these, guarded by Bhīma, is sufficient.",
    "notes": ["\"Insufficient\" can also be read as \"unlimited\", and \"sufficient\" as \"limited\", which makes Duryodhana confident in his own army rather than anxious about it."]
